      "body": "> > I'm not using Conda, are you?\n> \n> I'm not using Conda either. It's possible to fix this error by adding the word `const` to the variable declaration on this line:\n> \n> [BitNet/src/ggml-bitnet-mad.cpp](https://github.com/microsoft/BitNet/blob/01eb415772c342d9f20dc42772f1583ae1e5b102/src/ggml-bitnet-mad.cpp#L811)\n> \n> Line 811 in [01eb415](/microsoft/BitNet/commit/01eb415772c342d9f20dc42772f1583ae1e5b102)\n> \n>  int8_t * y_col = y + col * by; \n> Leaving it like that, the build works:\n> \n> const int8_t * y_col = y + col * by; \n> I opened a pull request to fix this.\n\nsame issue, fixed by adding const at line 811\n\n<img width=\"510\" height=\"115\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/92746179-c814-4fbc-98a5-a739bdf69f33\" />",
